        "ggAV1JRB3K3_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#122E0D;\">We source shilajit from select regions, hand-harvest it, and process it with pure water, avoiding harsh chemicals. Our GMP-certified and ISO-9001 compliant facilities ensure top safety and quality standards.</span></p>",
        "ggFKgYsqGb6_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#122E0D;\">Your well-being is our priority. Each batch of Wellness Nest shilajit undergoes rigorous testing for purity, authenticity, heavy metals, and bacteria. Every jar has a tamper-evident seal and a lot number for peace of mind.</span></p>",
