        "ggqPuCnsjId_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#122E0D;\">We don't just say our shilajit is pure – we prove it! Every batch is meticulously tested and verified by independent labs. We even offer certificates of authenticity, so you can rest assured you're getting genuine, top-quality shilajit.</span></p>",
